    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. what's the point? i look at my bank account and then i look at my bills and i just see a hole that never gets filled. it feels like i'm just a ghost in a machine, just moving numbers around until i eventually die from the stress anyway. it feels like there's no actual way out of the loop, you know? like the only way to actually stop the cycle is to just... not be in it anymore.",
